   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Braving the waters of the Chesapeake Bay at dawn, the region’s watermen have long been the lifeblood of its fishing and sailing traditions. Their resilience, skill, and deep connection to the bay shape a way of life passed down for generations. The Waterman watch honors this heritage with a rugged yet refined design. Its blue accents & brushed steel tones reflect the bay’s ever-changing waters, while bold markers ensure legibility—just like the instruments these mariners rely on. With every purchase, we support efforts to protect the Chesapeake Bay and the livelihoods that depend on it.",
