   "priceMinor": 37400,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Throw some crabs, oysters, and clams together along with corn cobs, potatoes, beer, melted butter –– and don’t you dare forget a generous amount of Old Bay seasoning. That’s what we call a “crab feast” in the Chesapeake Bay. Sure, we’re skipping a few steps and ingredients, but you get the idea. So beloved is the crab feast in these parts that we’ve designed a timepiece to satiate any wrist. Feast your eyes upon our Crab Feast watch –– with a vibrant red bezel that evokes the color of thoroughly-steamed crabs. The shimmery gold-rimmed display and strap elevates this timepiece into a feast for the eyes on par with the delicious mountain of seafood you’re about to consume with friends and family. Bon appetite!",
