   "priceMinor": 29900,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Upon seeing a horseshoe crab for the first time, most people think it time-traveled from the Jurassic era. So it might come as a surprise to learn they are on the cutting-edge of medical science; a chemical found only in this species’ blue blood is used by major pharmaceutical companies to save patients’ lives. Hence, our Horseshoe Crab has a smattering of blue across one hand and portion of its bezel to honor this unique distinction. Tying it all together is a chunky silicone (waterproof) strap adorned with perforations that resemble the holes which line the crab’s abdomen. Finally, a timepiece for those who want to impress others with their impeccable style –– and delightfully-nerdy knowledge of strange marine life.",
