   "priceMinor": 37400,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "The crack of a bat. The roar of a crowd. The savory scent of hot dogs in the air. Baseball is more than a game, it’s a tradition. Built on land that once served as the rail yard for the Baltimore and Ohio Railroad's Camden Station, Camden Yards has been keeping that tradition alive and well since 1992. Inspired by the B&O warehouse’s orange hue, and the colors of the team that play in its adjacent ballpark, our Camden timepiece allows you to show off your team spirit in style. Notice how the watch’s chapter ring has numbers in increments of five, which means it more effectively functions as a stopwatch than other dive watches in its class. The Camden is more than a watch –– it’s a piece of tradition you take with you everywhere you go.",
