   "priceMinor": 37400,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Stout and aggressive, Bull sharks are the only members of its species known to venture into freshwater –– sometimes navigating hundreds, if not thousands, of miles inland via rivers and creeks. So, if you ever see a dorsal fin piercing the surface of the Chesapeake Bay, there’s a good chance you know the culprit. Our Bull Shark timepiece prowls toward you with an aquatic palette consisting of silver, black, teal, and white. And like a single drop of blood in the water, the seconds hand features a red tip to draw the eye's attention. Whether you’re diving into adventure, or simply going out for a bite, strap this watch on for some instant apex status.",
